.TH man 1 "06 May 2010" "1.0" "retrode3-wlan man page"
.SH NAME
retrode3-wlan \- manage Retrode3 WLAN interface
.SH SYNOPSIS
testme [USERNAME]
.SH DESCRIPTION
retrode3-wlan is a testme.
.SH OPTIONS
The retrode3-wlan does not take any options. However, you can supply username.
.SH SEE ALSO
retrode3-admin(1) 
.SH BUGS
No known bugs.
.SH AUTHOR
H. Nikolaus Schaller (hns@goldelico.com)
